                ($(At)!2!(A)$) coordinate (Az)
                ($(B)!5cm!90:(O)$) coordinate (Bt) 
                ($(Bt)!2!(B)$) coordinate (Bz) node[below left]{$b$}
                ($(C)!1mm!90:(O)$) coordinate (Ct)
                (intersection of C--Ct and Bz--Bt) coordinate (N) (intersection of C--Ct and Az--At) coordinate (M)
